// concurrency/scope_cancel_siblings.wll - Phase E-B conformance fixture
//
// Demonstrates the plan §5.4.1 invariant: when one child of SCOPE
// terminates with an uncaught ERR (the fn body itself does not
// consume it via UNWRAP_OR / TRY / EXPECT_ERR), SCOPE returns that
// ERR to the caller. Plan §3 E3 + deviation P7-E3-001 note that
// path B runs children synchronously, so the sibling-cancel side
// effect has no in-flight sibling to interrupt; the fixture only
// locks the "SCOPE surfaces first child ERR" half of the contract.
//
// Companion fixture: scope_consume_does_not_change_return.wll
// covers the opposite half (consumed ERR does NOT propagate).
//
// Expected stdout (1 line):
//   ERR-surfaced
//
// Scope passed. SCOPE returns the first child ERR; outer call sites
// see IS_ERR(...) = TRUE.

LET(scope_err,
    SCOPE(FUN(() ,
        LET(h, SPAWN(FUN(() , ERR("from-child"))));
        LET(v, AWAIT(h));
        // Intentional: do NOT consume v — let it propagate to SCOPE.
        v
    ))
);
IF(IS_ERR(scope_err), PRINT("ERR-surfaced"), PRINT("did-not-surface"));

// [v1.0 spec §8.6] `IS_ERR` 是观察型消费者 —— 它不解除未消费状态(§8.6.1)
// ⇒ `scope_err` 里的 `ERR` 到作用域结束时仍未消费 ⇒ 丢弃点(§8.6.2 第 3 项)
// ⇒ `E0103`。故观察之后显式丢弃(§8.6.4)。本夹具演示的东西不变:SCOPE
// 把子 task 的未消费 `ERR` 交给调用方。
LET(_, scope_err);